'''Melody's Plateau''' is a sub-location of [[The Park]].

{{ZoneText|zone=Melody's Plateau|Talk to Melody &5♫&f.}}

== Features ==
'''Melody's Plateau''' features a few attractions.

=== Melody ===
{{Main|Melody}}
[[Melody]] is an [[NPC]] located in '''Melody's Plateau''', next to the acacia tree. The player can interact with her to select a song to play at the [[Harp]]. Perfecting a song allows the player to claim unique rewards from [[Melody]]. The player can also purchase a [[Personal Harp]] from [[Melody]] to play on their own [[Private Island]].

=== Harp ===
{{Main|Harp}}

The [[Harp]] is a feature located next to [[Melody]] in '''Melody's Plateau'''. The player can select one of many well-known, classical songs and play it. Doing so involves clicking on the falling wool blocks, to create the tune. Songs can be canceled at any time, but completing a song will display the percentage of correct clicks. A perfect score involves the player achieving {{Green|100%}}.

